\par\par \b \uc2  Brady Bonds End Dn But Off Intra-day Lows; EMBI Widens 2.03 \b0\par\par\uc2 356 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1998\par 23:23\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Mounting speculations that Venezuela is on the verge of devaluing its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed Brady bonds sharply weaker Friday. \par \par \uc2  Market participants noted, however, that the emerging market debt recovered from their intra-day lows, lifted by rebounding U.S. stocks. \par \par \uc2  After falling more than 270 points, the Dow Jones Industrial Average closed 77 points weaker to 8533 points. \par \par \uc2  The 34% devaluation of the Russian ruble Monday triggered speculative attacks on the Venezuelan bolivar driving the market into a selling frenzy. \par \par \uc2  Venezuelan Pars fell 1/2 to 59 1/2 bid, and the DCBs lost 1 1/2 to 46 1/2 bid. \par \par \uc2  Venezuela's government official - although reiterating they had no intention of devaluing the bolivar - said Friday that they will allow more flexibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the same band. The bolivar ended at VEB575.50 to the dollar from the VEB574.50 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "It's been a tough week," a trader said. "And there's more to come," he added, referring to the disclosure of the terms of Russia's domestic debt restructuring plan expected Monday. \par \par \uc2  Russian Principals retreated 1/2 to 18 1/2 bid, while the Eurobonds due in 2007 lost 5 1/2 to 32 bid. \par \par \uc2  Russia's State Duma is scheduled to consider the government's package of austerity measures in an emergency session Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders attributed the slump in emerging market debt also to speculations that \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily throughout the day to prop the country's markets. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's C-bonds tumbled 5 7/8 to 55 1/8 bid, while Pars surrendered 5 points to 57 1/2 bid. Mexican Pars gave up 3 3/4 to 71 3/4 bid, and the UMSs 2026 lost 9 1/2 to 88 bid. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The spread of the J.P. Morgan Emerging Markets Bond Index widened\par about 203 basis points to 1280 basis points over U.S. Treasurys.\par -By Enza Tedesco; 201-9382203; enza.tedesco@cor.dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  21-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2123GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1179 1810 4071 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du8l007kj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
