\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's real ends flat amid reported  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1998\par 22:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Aug 19 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real ended flat at 1.1740 to the dollar in the commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday amid speculation a large state bank stepped in selling the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Banco do Brasil \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the day on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling dollars in a bid to prevent the real from weakening. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials would not confirm the reports. Dealers have repeatedly spotted the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last week amid Asia and Russia's economic troubles. \par \par \uc2  At 1700 local/2000 GMT, preliminary figures for commercial and financial \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts showed a $200 million deficit, indicating a net outflow of dollars. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts showed a huge net dollar outflow of $963.83 million mainly because of repayment of maturing agricultural loans. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's outflow was the largest daily outflow of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Oct. 28, when the net dollar drain totalled $2.89 billion as Brazil was roiled by turmoil in Asian markets. \par \par \uc2  In the floating interbank rate market, the real dropped 0.04 to 1.1765 per dollar on Wednesday. In the parallel market, the real ended steady at 1.215 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  ((Carlos Sbarai, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5413)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8j0132x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
