\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Outflows \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 1998\par 00:32\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and another session of net dollar outflows weakened the Brazilian real (BRL) against the dollar Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In the spot market, the commercial dollar for 48-hour delivery closed with a buy rate of BRL1.1668 and a sell rate of BRL1.1673, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.16705, up from Tuesday's BRL1.1654. \par \par \uc2  Early in the day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  adjusted the mini-band in which the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, valuing the dollar at BRL1.1640/1.1730, up 0.10 centavos from BRL1.1630/1.1720 previously. \par \par \uc2  After July's massive inflow of $6.69 billion, August is poised to see net dollar outflows - which will keep pressure on the real. \par \par \uc2  Some $4 billion to $5 billion in so-called Rule 63 loans will mature this month, and some analysts estimate that only 30% of that total will be rolled over. \par \par \uc2  Rule 63 is a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  resolution allowing commercial banks to raise funds in overseas markets to make loans to customers in the agricultural sector. \par \par \uc2  In April, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  adopted restrictions to Rule 63 loans. The minimum borrowing term was increased to two years from six months. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market, the average interbank rate, or CDI, was flat at\par 2.12%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  05-08-98\par \