\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On Outflows; No  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 1998\par 23:06\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The dollar gained ground against the Brazilian real (BRL) Monday on a likely outflow of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the spot market, the commercial dollar for 48-hour delivery closed with a buy rate of BRL1.1642 and a sell rate of BRL1.1645, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.16435, up from Friday's BRL1.16350. \par \par \uc2  The real had been trading at the strongest point of its crawling band in recent days thanks to the privatization of telecommunications holding Telebras. \par \par \uc2  Winning bidders of Telebras were buying the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to settle their bids. Financial settlement is Tuesday, but all \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to be completed by Friday to meet banks' deadlines, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Reflecting that massive inflow, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data show a net $2.76 billion entered the commercial market Friday, while the floating-rates market posted a net outflow of $164 million. The net July inflow stood at $6.69 billion. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market, the average interbank rate, or CDI, fell to 2.13%\par from 2.15% Friday.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  03-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2106GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em000