\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Slides On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Outflows \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1998\par 23:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRL) weakened against the dollar Friday on the combined effects of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and net outflows of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Late in the session, preliminary \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed a net outflow of $100 million in the commercial-exchange market. \par \par \uc2  In the spot market, the dollar for 48-hour delivery closed with a buy rate of BRL1.1670 and a sell rate of BRL1.1675, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.16725, up from BRL1.16525 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened the real by adjusting the mini-band in which it trades againts the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The new band values the dollar at BRL1.1615/1.1705, up 0.10 centavos from the previous BRL1.1605-1.1695. \par \par \uc2  Delaers said next week's sale of telecommunications holding Telebras will boost the real as foreign investors cause a net inflow of dollars to pay for the assets being privatized. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the commercial market posted a net dollar outflow of $128 million, while the floating-rate market saw $58 million net exit. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market, the average interbank rate, or CDI, fell to 2.18%\par from 2.20% ahead of next Wednesday's expected cut in the basic interest\par rate, or TBC.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-07-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2100