\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 1998\par 23:19\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--A regular \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the Brazilian real's (BRL) crawling band was the only event in an otherwise quiet Wednesday session, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The so-called mini-band now values the dollar at BRL1.1555-1.1635, up 0.10 centavos from the previous BRL1.1545-1.1625. \par \par \uc2  The commercial dollar for 48-hour delivery closed with a buy rate of BRL1.1556 and a sell rate of BRL1.1557, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.15565, up from Tuesday's BRL1.15465. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed a net inflow of $191 million on the commercial market Tuesday, while the floating-rates market posted a net outflow of $63 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers now expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to adjust the crawling band by another 0.10 centavo before the end of the month. That would fulfill the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's practice of devaluing the real by 0.65 centavo each month. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market, the average interbank rate, or CDI, fell sharply\par from 2.23% to 2.28% ahead of Wednesday's Copom meeting to set the new\par basic interest rate, or TBC, for the following five weeks. The Copom,\par which is the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's monetary policy committee, began meeting\par shortly after 2000 GMT.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  24-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2119GMT\par \f