\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Unchanged After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 23:04\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRL) closed virtually unchanged Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  nudged up the ceiling of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's crawling band, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "That \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a surprise because no one was expecting a spread auction today," a dealer said, however noting that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was only following a previously announced policy of gradually widening the mini-band spread. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday moved the mini-band's ceiling up by 0.10 centavo, leaving its bottom unchanged. \par \par \uc2  The new mini-band values the dollar at BRL1.1545-1.1625, compared with BRL1.1545-BRL1.1615 previously. \par \par \uc2  The adjustment didn't mean much for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates. The dollar, which after the auction traded at BRL1.1555, remained on that level. \par \par \uc2  On the commercial-exchange market, the dollar for 48-hour delivery closed with a buy rate of BRL1.1553 and a sell rate of BRL1.1555, for a midpoint average of BRL1.1554, virtually unchanged from Wednesday's BRL1.1551. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data show a net inflow of $58.6 million on the commercial market Wednesday, while the floating-rates market posted a net outflow of $79 million. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money markets, the interbank rate, or CDI, was unchanged at\par 2.28%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580