\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Unchanged Vs Dlr, No  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 1998\par 21:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRL) closed unchanged against the dollar Wednesday on a day without \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended a touch below the strongest point of the mini-band in which it trades against the dollar. That mini-band, last adjusted Tuesday, values the dollar at BRL1.1510/1.1580. \par \par \uc2  The buy rate at the close was BRL1.1512 and the sell rate was BRL1.1513, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.15125, slightly up from Tuesday's BRL1.15095. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's failure to move may signal a net inflow of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data show a net outflow of $50 million on the commercial market Tuesday, while the floating-rates market saw a net outflow of $56 million. \par \par \uc2  In other market action Wednesday, the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange, or Bovespa, was heading to a sharply lower close ten minutes before the end of trading. The Bovespa Index was off 3.7%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market, the average interbank rate was unchanged at\par 2.28%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1959GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6304qnz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
