\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Firms Up \b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 1998\par 00:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRL) weakened against the dollar Tuesday on the heels of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but rallied against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  later on a large inflow of dollars, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The real closed at the strongest point of the newly-established mini-band, which values the dollar at BRL1.1510/1.1580. \par \par \uc2  The buy rate at close was BRL1.1509 and the sell rate was BRL1.1510, leaving the midpoint average at BRL1.15095. That's sharply lower than Monday's BRL1.1515. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated a net inflow of at least $230 million on the commercial-exchange market Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On Monday there was a net outflow of $83 million on the commercial market, while the floating-rates market saw a net outflow of $53 million. \par \par \uc2  In the money markets, the average interbank rate was unchanged at 2.28%. \par \par \uc2  In the weekly Treasury auction, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  placed all 2 million, 35-day National Treasury Notes, or LTNs, that it offered. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Two previous attempts to sell longer-maturity bills failed in the past\par weeks as banks demanded rates higher than what the government was\par willing to pay.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2220GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6204r2d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pi