monthly interbank rate (CDI) was\par unchanged from Monday's close of 2.49%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  22-04-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2124GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du4m003e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
