\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 22:56\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The real weakened Tuesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  adjusted the crawling band in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  But the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  then stabilized to close at the strongest point of the mini-band, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought excess dollars late in the session. \par \par \uc2  The commercial dollar's buy rate at close was 1.1369 reals and the sell rate was 1.1371 reals, letting the midpoint average at 1.13700, marginally higher than Monday's 1.13605. \par \par \uc2  The mini-band now values the dollar at 1.1370-1.1420 reals. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's session capped a month that could hardly have been better for the real. \par \par \uc2  Massive net dollar inflows, which as of Monday stood at $11.12 billion, helped strengthen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and beat February's record of $6.2 billion. \par \par \uc2  Privatization-related flows and renewed investor confidence accounted for much of that amount, dealers and analysts say. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the commercial exchange market registered a net inflow of $308 million, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data show. \par \par \uc2  In the interbank market, the average monthly interbank rate (CDI) was unchanged at 2.88%. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  repurchased securities in a go-around auction at an annual rate of 27.28% - down from the 27.30% it paid on Monday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  held 13 such auctions in March. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The basic interest rate, or TBC, stands at 28%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  31-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2056GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du3v0021p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
