\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Weakens On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 21:11\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--After letting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's crawling band stand untouched for a week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Brazil came to the market's rescue Wednesday, devaluing the real by 0.15 centavo. \par \par \uc2  Investors, who had been waiting for the move, sold long positions on the dollar, allowing the real to close at the strongest point of the newly set mini-band. \par \par \uc2  But the offer of dollars was so ample that at a late-session auction, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and prevent it from falling below the bottom of the mini-band. \par \par \uc2  The commercial dollar's buy rate at close was 1.1355 reals and the sell rate was 1.1356 reals, for a midpoint average of 1.13555, up from the 1.13450 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  Dealers point out that the inflow of dollars has declined in recent sessions. \par \par \uc2  "About a week and a half ago, the inflows were almost three times the outflows," one dealer said. But the accumulated net inflow for March stood at a record $6.63 billion on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The new band values the dollar at 1.1355-1.1405 reals, up 0.15 centavos from the 1.1340-1.1390 reals previously. \par \par \uc2  In the interbank market, the average monthly interbank rate (CDI) closed at 2.89%, unchanged from Tuesday's levels. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Earlier in the day, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  repurchased securities at an\par annual rate of 27.35%, the same rate it accepted to pay on Tuesday. The\par basic interest rate, known as TBC, stands at 28%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  25-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2011GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du3p001mw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
