\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Closes Stable Vs Dlr At Mini-Band Floor \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Januar 1998\par 19:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--In a calm session with one \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real closed Friday at the strongest point of the mini-band in which the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade. \par \par \uc2  Late in the first session of 1998, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars at 1.1160 reals. \par \par \uc2  The commercial dollar buy rate at close was 1.1160 reals and the sell rate was 1.1162 reals, for a midpoint of 1.1161, the same closing level of Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the session was calm and very illiquid. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the real by 0.15 of a centavo in its regular adjustment of the mini-band. \par \par \uc2  The new mini-band was set at 1.1160-1.1210 reals to the dollar, up from the previous band of 1.1145-1.1195 set on Dec. 22. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened the real by a total of 0.63% in the month of December. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the interbank market, interest rates were slightly down Friday. The\par average interbank rate (CDI) was at a monthly 3.85%, down from 3.93% on\par Wednesday, when the market operated only partially. Traders said the\par change wasn't significant.\par -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1855GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du12001i