\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. Dlr Up 0.2 Centavo To 96.6 On Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1995\par 21:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar rose 0.2 centavo Wednesday to 96.6 centavos on \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  once. \par \par \uc2  At closing, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were quoting the dollar at a buy rate of 96.54 centavos and a sell rate of 96.56 centavos at the commercial rate, up 0.2 centavo from Tuesday, said a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moved the buy rate to 96.6 centavos from 96.4 centavos and its sell rate to 97.1 centavos from 96.9 centavos. This is the rate the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses to buy and sell dollars and is used as a benchmark, but \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers aren't obliged to follow the exact rates. \par \par \uc2  On June 22 the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a new exchange rate band for the dollar of 91-99 centavos, from a previous range of 88-93 centavos. The move is seen as allowing the real to continue its gradual devaluation against the dollar. At the end of 1994, the dollar was trading at around 85 centavos on Brazil's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Since then, it has carried out several mini-devaluations of the real to nudge the dollar upward in small increments. Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the dollar's value to its present rate from 96.1 centavos. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-11-95 \par \par \uc2  2004GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbt09hao\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
